  "description": "Grace, the head of the House of Ellysia – known as both a saint and a demon for her mysterious ability to turn back time – had saved countless lives. Yet, she could never cure her own illness.\n\n*“I’m so tired… I just want to rest.”*\n\nJust as she finally found peace in death…\n\n*“Where am I?”\n\n“Three hundred years have passed since I died?”*\n\nSuddenly, she finds herself in the body of Ceres – the eldest daughter of a completely ruined noble house! Well, 300 years or whatever – that’s all fine and dandy, but…\n\n*“Excuse me, have you happened to see my blue stone?”\n\n“If you can’t pay with money, pay with your body.”\n\n“Drop dead!”\n\n\"…Can’t I just live a quiet life for once?\"*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
